# The image only needs src/, configs/model/, one vocab and one checkpoint (see Dockerfile COPY lines).
# Everything else is excluded so the build upload does not carry the 2.4 GB raw corpus.
# gitignore semantics: patterns are anchored with a leading slash so they only exclude top-level
# entries, and every parent directory on the way to a kept file is re-included explicitly.
/*
!/Dockerfile
!/pyproject.toml
!/README.md
!/src/
!/configs/
/configs/*
!/configs/model/
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/hingmix/
/data/hingmix/*
!/data/hingmix/v0.1/
/data/hingmix/v0.1/*
!/data/hingmix/v0.1/vocab.json
!/artifacts/
/artifacts/*
!/artifacts/e0_lstm_w_m_475k_real_s42_best.pt
__pycache__/
*.pyc
